WEBVTT

00:00:05.050 --> 00:00:08.400
He was walking with God.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:12.010
He noticed footprints in the sand.

00:00:13.110 --> 00:00:15.080
The sky was dazzlingly bright,

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:18.460
and in the footprints, he could see his life.

00:00:19.520 --> 00:00:23.130
During the happy and joyous times in his life,

00:00:23.130 --> 00:00:28.070
there were two sets of footprints.

00:00:32.110 --> 00:00:39.300
But when he was suffering from anguish or

00:00:39.300 --> 00:00:41.930
drowning in his sorrows,

00:00:41.930 --> 00:00:45.820
he could see only one set of footprints.

00:00:46.550 --> 00:00:51.960
<i>God, you were with me
all those times I was happy,</i>

00:00:51.960 --> 00:00:56.310
<i>all the good times in my life.</i>

00:00:58.680 --> 00:01:04.110
<i>But why, when I needed
you most by my side,</i>

00:01:04.110 --> 00:01:08.050
<i>have you not been there for me?</i>

00:02:41.420 --> 00:02:47.200
<b>First Hour: Takuma</b>

00:03:08.450 --> 00:03:11.730
Weren't we going to school?

00:03:11.730 --> 00:03:13.520
I don't know!

00:03:13.520 --> 00:03:17.310
He's saying, "Don't come near
my territory! Charge!"

00:03:18.240 --> 00:03:20.690
You can speak boar?

00:03:20.690 --> 00:03:24.180
Of course! I'm the TimeSound
Spirit, Otoha-chan!

00:03:27.420 --> 00:03:28.190
Huh?

00:03:28.190 --> 00:03:29.520
Otoha-chan?

00:03:29.520 --> 00:03:31.290
Otoha-chan?

00:03:46.670 --> 00:03:47.740
You okay?

00:03:48.840 --> 00:03:50.530
Who are you?

00:03:57.180 --> 00:03:58.650
Soft...

00:04:05.440 --> 00:04:07.230
I'm blind.

00:04:07.230 --> 00:04:09.330
No one knows why.

00:04:09.330 --> 00:04:12.680
The doctors say there's nothing
really wrong with me.

00:04:13.350 --> 00:04:14.660
But I'm blind.

00:04:14.660 --> 00:04:16.570
That's certain, even if nothing else is.

00:04:18.140 --> 00:04:20.060
This is my world.

00:04:20.060 --> 00:04:21.500
The sound of the wind,

00:04:21.500 --> 00:04:23.160
the smell of the grass,

00:04:23.160 --> 00:04:25.970
the feel of the earth beneath my feet.

00:04:25.970 --> 00:04:27.700
The warmth of the sun.

00:04:27.700 --> 00:04:29.000
That's all there is.

00:04:30.710 --> 00:04:32.850
Um, I'm sorry.

00:04:32.850 --> 00:04:34.470
I didn't mean to...

00:04:34.470 --> 00:04:38.320
I just asked a girl named "Otoha-chan"
for directions, and she it said it was this way.

00:04:39.200 --> 00:04:42.010
She's a mysterious girl.

00:04:42.010 --> 00:04:43.980
She thinks she's a spirit...

00:04:43.980 --> 00:04:44.990
Don't talk.

00:04:45.930 --> 00:04:47.930
U-Um...

00:04:47.930 --> 00:04:48.800
I know!

00:04:48.800 --> 00:04:50.700
I didn't hear your name.

00:04:50.700 --> 00:04:52.440
I'm Hirose Takuma.

00:04:54.640 --> 00:04:58.000
School's straight this way.

00:04:58.000 --> 00:04:59.570
Goodbye.

00:05:00.310 --> 00:05:02.440
Won't you come with me?

00:05:02.440 --> 00:05:04.390
You're in middle school, too.

00:05:04.390 --> 00:05:05.780
I can tell by your voice.

00:05:05.780 --> 00:05:06.540
Um...

00:05:06.540 --> 00:05:08.320
Stay away from me.

00:05:12.580 --> 00:05:13.920
A transfer student?

00:05:13.920 --> 00:05:16.830
I heard the teachers talking about it yesterday.

00:05:16.830 --> 00:05:18.340
It must be true.

00:05:18.340 --> 00:05:20.330
But why here?

00:05:20.330 --> 00:05:22.300
The student's coming here
to recover from an illness.

00:05:22.300 --> 00:05:24.900
I think the name was...

00:05:29.440 --> 00:05:30.640
Hinata-chan...

00:05:32.380 --> 00:05:34.210
Good morning.

00:05:36.880 --> 00:05:39.160
What are you doing?

00:05:39.160 --> 00:05:42.810
I'm carrying classroom materials.

00:05:42.810 --> 00:05:44.570
I can see that.

00:05:44.570 --> 00:05:46.890
Why are you trying to carry them all at once?

00:05:46.890 --> 00:05:48.960
You should make two trips.

00:05:48.960 --> 00:05:50.350
Two trips?

00:05:51.570 --> 00:05:52.820
I see!

00:05:52.820 --> 00:05:54.600
You're right.

00:05:54.600 --> 00:05:56.480
I didn't think of that.

00:05:56.480 --> 00:06:00.070
You're the same as ever, Hinata-chan.

00:06:00.070 --> 00:06:02.190
Oh, fine.

00:06:02.190 --> 00:06:03.470
Help me out, Hamaji.

00:06:03.470 --> 00:06:05.680
Sure.

00:06:05.680 --> 00:06:09.360
Hamaji!

00:06:09.360 --> 00:06:11.150
C-Crap.

00:06:11.150 --> 00:06:14.870
You skipped out on cleaning duty yesterday.

00:06:16.960 --> 00:06:18.460
Wait!

00:06:18.460 --> 00:06:19.820
Hey!

00:06:19.820 --> 00:06:24.090
Oh, well... Let's hurry.

00:06:24.090 --> 00:06:25.730
They say a transfer student's coming.

00:06:25.730 --> 00:06:27.470
A transfer student?

00:06:37.030 --> 00:06:38.750
You all right?

00:06:38.750 --> 00:06:40.160
Wait a second.

00:06:40.160 --> 00:06:42.740
I'll drop these off and come back right away.

00:06:48.430 --> 00:06:50.210
A transfer student...

00:06:50.210 --> 00:06:51.580
Then...

00:06:56.900 --> 00:06:59.060
This feeling...

00:06:59.060 --> 00:07:00.290
What is it?

00:07:03.410 --> 00:07:04.800
Um, I'm sorry!

00:07:05.380 --> 00:07:07.580
Where is the teacher's office?

00:07:13.430 --> 00:07:16.150
Takuma-kun is blind.

00:07:16.160 --> 00:07:21.390
<b>Hirose
Takuma</b>

00:07:16.500 --> 00:07:18.770
All of you, do what you can to help him.

00:07:18.770 --> 00:07:22.040
Um... You can sit...

00:07:23.260 --> 00:07:26.320
The only open seat is next to Kohinata-san.

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:29.140
Student Rep, show him to his seat.

00:07:29.140 --> 00:07:29.930
Right.

00:07:33.160 --> 00:07:36.630
I'm the Student Rep, Kagura Hinata.

00:07:36.630 --> 00:07:40.380
Oh, okay. You're the Student Rep.

00:07:40.380 --> 00:07:41.790
Hi.

00:07:42.390 --> 00:07:44.480
Um... Uh...

00:07:45.870 --> 00:07:48.480
Could you put out your elbow?

00:07:49.240 --> 00:07:50.260
Okay!

00:07:54.080 --> 00:07:55.750
Here.

00:07:55.750 --> 00:07:57.660
This is your chair.

00:07:57.660 --> 00:07:59.020
Thank you.

00:08:03.530 --> 00:08:05.930
Kohinata-san, you're late.

00:08:06.820 --> 00:08:08.100
Okay.

00:08:08.100 --> 00:08:09.400
<i>That voice...</i>

00:08:11.200 --> 00:08:13.200
Wait.

00:08:13.200 --> 00:08:14.280
As punishment,

00:08:14.280 --> 00:08:16.000
you're not allowed to attend class.

00:08:16.000 --> 00:08:16.570
Stand in the hall—

00:08:16.570 --> 00:08:18.010
Please wait a second!

00:08:19.840 --> 00:08:21.180
You're...

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:25.200
She helped me when I was lost this morning.

00:08:25.200 --> 00:08:27.890
That might be why she's late.

00:08:27.890 --> 00:08:29.030
So...

00:08:29.910 --> 00:08:31.720
Oh, all right...

00:08:31.720 --> 00:08:33.000
Sit.

00:08:34.140 --> 00:08:35.330
Okay.

00:08:39.220 --> 00:08:40.870
So, your name's Kohinata-san.

00:08:42.940 --> 00:08:44.540
That was unnecessary.

00:08:52.070 --> 00:08:53.930
And this...

00:08:53.930 --> 00:08:56.010
The art room, right?

00:08:56.010 --> 00:08:59.790
Wow, how could you tell?

00:08:59.790 --> 00:09:01.950
I can smell paint.

00:09:01.950 --> 00:09:04.460
But you knew what all the other classrooms

00:09:04.460 --> 00:09:06.860
were before we could tell you...

00:09:06.860 --> 00:09:08.810
They all have their own smell.

00:09:10.280 --> 00:09:12.660
The library smells like old paper.

00:09:12.660 --> 00:09:14.920
The nurse's office, like disinfectant.

00:09:14.920 --> 00:09:18.130
The music room smells like the spray
they use on the instruments.

00:09:18.130 --> 00:09:20.940
Even if you can't see it,
you can actually tell a lot.

00:09:20.940 --> 00:09:22.310
I see.

00:09:22.310 --> 00:09:24.230
That's amazing.

00:09:24.230 --> 00:09:28.680
It's really impressive that you
could tell all that, Hirose-sama!

00:09:28.680 --> 00:09:30.460
"Sama"? Me?

00:09:31.630 --> 00:09:36.900
Yes. You just seem like a "sama," somehow.

00:09:36.900 --> 00:09:40.710
Well, if you want to call me
that, I won't stop you.

00:09:40.710 --> 00:09:42.090
Stop!

00:09:42.090 --> 00:09:44.990
I finally found you, transfer student.

00:09:45.000 --> 00:09:49.400
You've got guts, looking around
the school without my permission.

00:09:50.930 --> 00:09:51.570
Who's that?

00:09:51.570 --> 00:09:53.320
Remember this!

00:09:57.280 --> 00:10:00.430
I'm the leader of the school,
the perfect beauty,

00:10:00.430 --> 00:10:01.910
Tabata Yui-sama.

00:10:03.770 --> 00:10:05.650
Another "sama"?

00:10:05.650 --> 00:10:08.110
If you ever want it, let me know...

00:10:08.110 --> 00:10:10.770
There's one opening left to be my servant.

00:10:10.770 --> 00:10:11.920
Sigh.

00:10:11.920 --> 00:10:13.760
What is that sigh?

00:10:13.760 --> 00:10:16.240
Is she always like this?

00:10:16.240 --> 00:10:17.860
Yeah, I guess...

00:10:17.860 --> 00:10:21.620
You can ignore half of what she says.

00:10:21.620 --> 00:10:23.110
Not half.

00:10:23.110 --> 00:10:25.580
Ninety percent is fine.

00:10:25.580 --> 00:10:28.340
Hamaji!

00:10:29.890 --> 00:10:31.280
Wait!

00:10:31.480 --> 00:10:32.380
Hirose-sama!

00:10:35.680 --> 00:10:38.150
Ow...

00:10:39.290 --> 00:10:40.620
What's this?

00:10:40.620 --> 00:10:42.870
Oh, man...

00:10:42.870 --> 00:10:46.220
Some service for him on his
first day, huh, Hinata-chan?

00:10:46.840 --> 00:10:48.060
Um, service?

00:10:49.290 --> 00:10:53.730
Uh, could you stop breathing there?

00:10:53.730 --> 00:10:55.850
I-It tickles...

00:10:57.320 --> 00:10:58.900
Don't move...

00:10:58.900 --> 00:11:01.990
No, but um...

00:11:12.630 --> 00:11:15.590
I went with you, so you wouldn't get hurt.

00:11:15.590 --> 00:11:18.250
I'm a failure as a student rep.

00:11:18.250 --> 00:11:19.650
I'm fine.

00:11:19.650 --> 00:11:22.100
It's just a little bump.

00:11:22.100 --> 00:11:23.760
Actually, it was worth it.

00:11:23.760 --> 00:11:24.890
Huh?

00:11:24.890 --> 00:11:27.320
Nothing, nothing at all.

00:11:27.320 --> 00:11:30.180
Anyway, I'm fine.
Let's go back to the classroom...

00:11:30.180 --> 00:11:33.490
No! Please keep resting!

00:11:33.490 --> 00:11:36.390
I'll talk to the teacher.

00:11:37.590 --> 00:11:38.410
But...

00:11:38.410 --> 00:11:40.290
Please!

00:11:40.290 --> 00:11:41.680
I'm worried!

00:11:43.890 --> 00:11:44.880
All right.

00:11:44.880 --> 00:11:49.580
Then I guess I'll nap through
a bit of my first day.

00:11:49.580 --> 00:11:50.740
Okay.

00:11:54.690 --> 00:11:57.610
I'm going to class.

00:11:57.610 --> 00:12:00.380
I'll be back at lunch.

00:12:00.380 --> 00:12:01.390
Sure.

00:12:03.630 --> 00:12:05.660
Hinata-chan, huh?

00:12:05.660 --> 00:12:07.510
Everyone in the country is so nice...

00:12:07.510 --> 00:12:09.070
You called me?

00:12:11.380 --> 00:12:13.970
Takuma-kun!

00:12:18.220 --> 00:12:18.980
Who are you?

00:12:18.980 --> 00:12:20.460
It's me,

00:12:20.460 --> 00:12:22.520
the TimeSound Spirit, Otoha!

00:12:22.520 --> 00:12:23.540
I's awful of you to have forgotten.

00:12:23.540 --> 00:12:24.890
You're the Promised One!

00:12:24.890 --> 00:12:29.160
Promised One?

00:12:35.380 --> 00:12:37.030
<b>Cockroach Woman Pig</b>

00:12:57.350 --> 00:13:01.190
Okay! I, Yui-sama, am on lunch duty today!

00:13:01.190 --> 00:13:03.320
Line up, already!

00:13:05.770 --> 00:13:07.660
<i>That's not true at all!</i>

00:13:10.670 --> 00:13:13.030
<i>I'll never be able to see.</i>

00:13:13.030 --> 00:13:14.340
<i>Why?</i>

00:13:14.340 --> 00:13:17.600
<i>Because I never have!</i>

00:13:17.600 --> 00:13:20.310
<i>Ever since then, my eyes
have always been...</i>

00:13:22.950 --> 00:13:25.720
<i>Why won't you believe me?</i>

00:13:25.720 --> 00:13:26.740
<i>That hurts!</i>

00:13:26.740 --> 00:13:27.820
<i>Stop!</i>

00:13:29.530 --> 00:13:31.670
<i>You're the Promised One!</i>

00:13:31.670 --> 00:13:34.660
<i>That's why I can help you...</i>

00:13:34.660 --> 00:13:36.470
<i>What do you mean by Promised...</i>

00:13:37.040 --> 00:13:38.460
<i>Don't give up.</i>

00:13:45.160 --> 00:13:46.400
Here's your lunch.

00:13:46.400 --> 00:13:48.930
I'll help you eat.

00:13:48.930 --> 00:13:52.380
If you give me the spoon, I'll be fine.

00:13:52.380 --> 00:13:53.710
There's not enough!

00:13:53.710 --> 00:13:55.390
Who took an extra squid ring?

00:13:55.390 --> 00:13:58.050
I refuse to believe that someone would do this

00:13:58.050 --> 00:13:59.390
while I'm on lunch duty!

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:01.990
Who took it?

00:13:59.390 --> 00:14:01.990
It's kind of noisy...

00:14:01.990 --> 00:14:05.050
Don't worry about it, Hirose-sama.

00:14:05.050 --> 00:14:08.060
But that almost never happens.

00:14:09.240 --> 00:14:11.690
Hamaji, did you take it?

00:14:11.690 --> 00:14:15.220
I'd love to eat it, but I didn't!

00:14:15.220 --> 00:14:16.520
Maki?

00:14:16.520 --> 00:14:18.240
Of course I didn't!

00:14:19.050 --> 00:14:21.270
Then... I knew it!

00:14:30.080 --> 00:14:32.320
U-Um...

00:14:32.320 --> 00:14:33.520
Kohinata!

00:14:33.520 --> 00:14:35.050
You did it, didn't you?

00:14:39.300 --> 00:14:40.920
Say something!

00:14:40.920 --> 00:14:41.860
Cockroach!

00:14:49.670 --> 00:14:50.820
All right.

00:14:50.820 --> 00:14:53.270
If you're going to insist on saying nothing...

00:14:53.270 --> 00:14:54.340
Um...

00:14:56.610 --> 00:14:58.280
You can have mine.

00:14:59.520 --> 00:15:01.380
Then did you take it?

00:15:01.380 --> 00:15:04.260
No, I didn't.

00:15:04.260 --> 00:15:06.770
But I'm pretty sure that, since I transfered,
there's one more person,

00:15:06.770 --> 00:15:09.100
so that's why you're missing one.

00:15:09.100 --> 00:15:09.550
So...

00:15:09.550 --> 00:15:10.990
Don't do that!

00:15:16.050 --> 00:15:16.890
Wait!

00:15:24.410 --> 00:15:25.640
That girl!

00:15:29.820 --> 00:15:31.630
Hinata-chan, let's go!

00:15:32.450 --> 00:15:33.210
We have to follow her.

00:15:33.210 --> 00:15:35.250
You shouldn't.

00:15:36.070 --> 00:15:38.450
Hinata-chan.

00:15:44.110 --> 00:15:45.220
Hirose-sama!

00:15:47.920 --> 00:15:49.360
Kohinata-san!

00:15:50.690 --> 00:15:53.980
<i>They showed me around the school,
so I know most of the layout.</i>

00:15:53.980 --> 00:15:55.800
<i>The stairs are up here...</i>

00:15:59.040 --> 00:16:01.240
Kohinata-san, where are you?

00:16:01.240 --> 00:16:04.350
<i>The shoe boxes are in front of the stairs.</i>

00:16:05.810 --> 00:16:07.340
Kohinata-san!

00:16:08.080 --> 00:16:09.280
You're there, aren't you?

00:16:09.280 --> 00:16:10.710
Kohinata-san.

00:16:16.620 --> 00:16:18.220
Don't cause problems for me.

00:16:18.220 --> 00:16:20.510
Kohinata-san.

00:16:20.510 --> 00:16:22.390
Hayami.

00:16:22.390 --> 00:16:26.230
I don't like that last name.

00:16:33.220 --> 00:16:34.540
<b>Men's Super-Thick!
MISO</b>

00:16:34.540 --> 00:16:36.540
Do you always have one ready?

00:16:36.540 --> 00:16:38.840
I don't get to eat a lot.

00:16:38.840 --> 00:16:39.870
I see.

00:16:39.870 --> 00:16:42.940
The countryside's easygoing and peaceful,

00:16:42.940 --> 00:16:44.550
and everyone's nice...

00:16:44.550 --> 00:16:46.580
That's what I thought.

00:16:46.580 --> 00:16:48.490
But it's not true, is it?

00:16:50.110 --> 00:16:51.820
Why didn't you tell them?

00:16:51.820 --> 00:16:55.270
If you talk to them, there wouldn't be fighting.

00:16:55.270 --> 00:16:57.260
Yui-chan doesn't seem like a bad person.

00:16:58.430 --> 00:16:59.980
A lecture?

00:16:59.980 --> 00:17:01.650
That's not it!

00:17:05.990 --> 00:17:07.510
Miso-ramen.

00:17:07.510 --> 00:17:08.620
Is that bad?

00:17:08.620 --> 00:17:12.090
No, I like it, too.

00:17:15.970 --> 00:17:17.970
No, I didn't mean that...

00:17:17.970 --> 00:17:20.350
It just smelled good.

00:17:20.350 --> 00:17:21.620
Hayami-chan...

00:17:21.620 --> 00:17:23.270
Just one bite.

00:17:34.130 --> 00:17:35.600
It's good!

00:17:35.600 --> 00:17:37.950
I've never had such good ramen.

00:17:38.870 --> 00:17:40.540
There's no point in trying to flatter me.

00:17:40.540 --> 00:17:42.110
I'm not giving you any more.

00:17:43.000 --> 00:17:45.580
No, it really is good.

00:17:48.870 --> 00:17:50.040
You're an idiot.

00:17:50.040 --> 00:17:52.180
It's just instant ramen.

00:17:53.020 --> 00:17:55.000
There you are.

00:17:56.720 --> 00:17:59.560
You ruined my lunch!

00:17:59.560 --> 00:18:02.310
You know what's going to happen, right?

00:18:02.990 --> 00:18:04.950
What is it, Hirose?

00:18:04.950 --> 00:18:07.830
I'm talking with Hayami-chan right now.

00:18:07.830 --> 00:18:09.620
Could you come back later?

00:18:09.620 --> 00:18:11.880
You gonna try and protect her?

00:18:11.880 --> 00:18:12.800
Yeah!

00:18:12.800 --> 00:18:14.030
She's...

00:18:16.860 --> 00:18:18.600
Let's go out behind the school.

00:18:20.000 --> 00:18:21.650
Hayami-chan!

00:18:21.650 --> 00:18:23.800
You can't follow me anyway.

00:18:24.510 --> 00:18:26.840
Don't do anything!

00:18:26.840 --> 00:18:29.520
You can't, anyway.

00:18:31.230 --> 00:18:32.280
Wait!

00:18:43.000 --> 00:18:44.770
<b>Kagura</b>

00:18:45.460 --> 00:18:48.270
I'm back.

00:18:48.270 --> 00:18:52.240
Well, did Hirose-sama arrive?

00:18:53.840 --> 00:18:55.290
Yes.

00:19:11.640 --> 00:19:13.430
We're celebrating your moving in!

00:19:13.430 --> 00:19:16.100
Eat up!

00:19:16.100 --> 00:19:19.270
I got a call from your dad.

00:19:19.270 --> 00:19:21.590
Wanted to know if you're doing well.

00:19:21.590 --> 00:19:22.550
I see.

00:19:23.830 --> 00:19:25.940
Something happen at school?

00:19:25.940 --> 00:19:30.710
Hey, don't worry.
You'll make friends in no time!

00:19:38.690 --> 00:19:40.520
I...

00:19:40.920 --> 00:19:43.040
<i>Don't do anything!</i>

00:19:43.040 --> 00:19:44.990
<i>You can't, anyway.</i>

00:19:46.610 --> 00:19:49.470
I can't do anything.

00:20:07.110 --> 00:20:10.820
2.38 in the morning.

00:20:13.160 --> 00:20:15.630
You don't like being unable to do anything?

00:20:17.560 --> 00:20:19.160
You're...

00:20:19.790 --> 00:20:21.160
Put your hand out.

00:20:38.180 --> 00:20:39.720
Where are we?

00:20:46.880 --> 00:20:48.530
Come out here!

00:20:50.460 --> 00:20:52.530
You can do it!

00:21:12.920 --> 00:21:14.070
See?

00:21:14.070 --> 00:21:17.300
It's not that you can't do it.

00:21:17.300 --> 00:21:19.640
You just think you can't.

00:21:19.640 --> 00:21:20.750
Otoha-chan...

00:21:21.560 --> 00:21:23.960
All the TimeSound Spirit can do

00:21:23.960 --> 00:21:27.540
is give you a bit of time.

00:21:27.540 --> 00:21:30.530
How you use it... That's up to you.

00:21:30.530 --> 00:21:33.730
Do your best, Promised One.

00:21:56.920 --> 00:21:59.530
<i>No, it really is good.</i>

00:22:03.790 --> 00:22:06.900
I had no idea it was so pretty...

00:22:20.230 --> 00:22:23.720
Let's go, Hayami-chan.

00:24:00.720 --> 00:24:04.250
The H2O comes from the first letters
of the heroines' names!

00:24:04.250 --> 00:24:04.910
Hayami.

00:24:04.910 --> 00:24:06.010
Hamaji!

00:24:06.010 --> 00:24:07.380
Otoha!

00:24:07.380 --> 00:24:08.620
The three of us together are...

00:24:08.620 --> 00:24:11.820
H2O!

00:24:11.450 --> 00:24:15.030
<b>Second Hour:
Hayami</b>

00:24:11.820 --> 00:24:14.260
What about me?
